I just realized -- this approach won't work because it can't be serialized correctly. If you do `Dense(... kernel_initializer=value)`, to keep the layer serializable, the initializer must be serializable too.

We already have a serializable initializer that handles constant values: `Constant`

So you can just do:

```
elif ops.is_tensor(identifier) or isinstance(
        identifier, (np.generic, np.ndarray)
):
    return Constant(identifier)
```

or something along those lines
